pe. Always ",[218,289,290],{},"webhook_event",[239,292,293,298,302],{},[257,294,295],{},[218,296,297],{},"eventName",[257,299,300],{},[218,301,266],{},[257,303,304,305,308,309,312,313,316,317,320],{},"The event name, such as ",[218,306,307],{},"order.paid",", ",[218,310,311],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[218,314,315],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[223,318,225],{"href":319},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[239,322,323,328,333],{},[257,324,325],{},[218,326,327],{},"reason",[257,329,330],{},[218,331,332],{},"string | null",[257,334,335,336,339,340,343,344,308,347,312,350,353],{},"Why the event fired, for events with more than one cause. Always present; ",[218,337,338],{},"null"," for every event except ",[218,341,342],{},"subscription.updated",", where it is ",[218,345,346],{},"updated_immediately",[218,348,349],{},"updated_on_renewal",[218,351,352],{},"renewed",". New values may be added over time.",[239,355,356,361,365],{},[257,357,358],{},[218,359,360],{},"entityType",[257,362,363],{},[218,364,266],{},[257,366,367,368,308,371,308,374,308,377,308,380,312,383,226],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[218,369,370],{},"order",[218,372,373],{},"refund",[218,375,376],{},"subscription",[218,378,379],{},"checkout",[218,381,382],{},"one_off_product",[218,384,385],{},"subscription_plan",[239,387,388,393,397],{},[257,389,390],{},[218,391,392],{},"entityId",[257,394,395],{},[218,396,266],{},[257,398,399],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[239,401,402,407,411],{},[257,403,404],{},[218,405,406],{},"object",[257,408,409],{},[218,410,406],{},[257,412,413,414,416,417,420,421,423,424,427,428,226],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[218,415,280],{}," field. Note ",[218,418,419],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[218,422,360],{},": chargeback events carry ",[218,42